WEBVTT

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:02.120
So to clarify the architecture in

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.000
my head, the beautiful visual canvas

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.740
diagram of concepts we built in

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.380
the ontology interface, and the physical

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.620
materialized graph database sitting

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.059
in OneLake are doing two completely

00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:15.799
different jobs. Precisely.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.680
The visual diagram is the conceptual

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.420
map of meaning for the AI.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.020
The materialized graph is a specialized

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.620
physical execution path for deep relationship

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.720
questions. And the routing intelligence

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.340
chooses the path based on this

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.700
specific structure of the question

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:30.319
being asked.
